@startuml uc13_manage_team
title UC-13 — Manage the team (FR-04, FR-03)

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor Admin
participant "requireCan('member',·)\n(route seam)" as Gate
participant MembersController as Ctrl
participant MembersService as Svc
participant UserRepository as Repo

Admin -> Gate : GET /members
activate Gate
alt not an admin
  Gate -->x Admin : 403 ForbiddenError
else admin
  Gate -> Ctrl : list
  Ctrl -> Svc : list(scope)
  Svc -> Repo : members of this tenant only (ADR-0033)
  Repo --> Ctrl : roster
  Ctrl --> Admin : members
end
deactivate Gate

Admin -> Gate : PATCH /members/:id/roles { roles }
Gate -> Ctrl : setRoles (requireCan passed)
Ctrl -> Svc : setRoles(id, roles, scope)
note right of Svc : last-admin invariant enforced per tenant —\na team can't lock itself out of administration
Svc --> Admin : updated member
note over Admin : all members then share the team's recruiting data (team scope)
@enduml
